cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "PolyProton"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
message: >-
  If you use PolyProton, please cite the software release.
  The references below describe methodological foundations
  of the workflow.
version: "1.0.0"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/ataborosi/PolyProton"

authors:
  - family-names: Taborosi
    given-names: Attila
    affiliation: "Shinshu University"

abstract: >-
  An automated molecular simulation workflow for constructing,
  parameterizing, equilibrating, and analyzing sulfonated
  polyimide electrolyte systems using Amber molecular dynamics.

keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - polymer electrolytes
  - sulfonated polyimides
  - proton conductivity
  - automation

references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Molecular Dynamics Simulation of Polymer Electrolyte Membrane
      for Understanding Structure and Proton Conductivity at Various
      Hydration Levels Using Neural Network Potential
